sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant K as kalari
  participant G as Gate
  participant M as msb
  participant S as aashaan
  participant E as Evidence

  A->>K: run_in_sandbox
  K->>G: decide caps paths net secrets
  G-->>K: allow or refuse
  K->>M: create --no-net plus one rule
  K->>M: copy workspace and aashaan
  K->>M: exec aashaan caps command
  M->>S: run candidate
  S-->>M: verdict killed or exited
  M->>S: run baseline and checks
  K->>M: stop and remove
  K->>E: store verdict and logs
  K-->>A: verdict and log tail
